#ASSERT `s 523(2) the court, judge or justice may vacate or vary the order previously made and make any other order for the detention or release of the accused` `s 523(2)(c)(iii) with consent, or on such an application, if the accused is charged with an offence other than an offence listed in section 469, the justice by whom an order was made under this Part or any other justice, at any time until a sentence within the meaning of section 673 is imposed` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
